{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41847","headline":"送庐阜僧归山阳 · 李中","name":"送庐阜僧归山阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山阳旧社终经梦，容易言归不可留。\n瓶贮瀑泉离五老，锡摇江雨上孤舟。\n鱼行细浪分沙觜，鴈逆高风下苇洲。\n遥想枚臯宅边寺，不知凉月共谁游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}